        "text": "Framing and exact resolver: forecast the Statistics Canada Labour Force Survey unemployment rate for Canada, seasonally adjusted, first print, percent rounded to one decimal. Table 14-10-0287-01 is the release table used by The Daily. I keep the ledger top-level resolutionSourceUrl and resolutionDate as supplied, but the official schedule and the dq260605a page show a concrete discrepancy: dq260605a is Labour Force Survey, May 2026, released 2026-06-05, while the official release schedule lists Labour Force Survey, June 2026, for 2026-07-10."
